 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-wave4",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "draft_py": "# M20 Mask of Immolation {1}{R} Artifact - Equipment\n# 1 \"When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token, then attach this\n#   Equipment to it.\"  compiled (B15-etb-create-attach), kept.\n# 2 'Equipped creature has \"Sacrifice this creature: It deals 1 damage to any target.\"'\n#   A static GRANT_ABILITY over the equipped creature (B11 \"equipped creature\": IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE\n#   + TYPE_EQ 'Creature' in a static) of an ActivatedAbility (the engine's granted-activation lane,\n#   layers.granted_activated). Its cost is M21 Selfless Savior's \"Sacrifice this creature:\"\n#   (CostSacrifice over IS_SOURCE: the source of a granted ability is the creature that has it);\n#   \"It deals 1 damage to any target\" is M21 Silent Dart's sacrificed-source DEAL_DAMAGE with\n#   Chandra, Heart of Fire's any-target selector.\n# 3 \"Equip {2}\" compiled (with ActivationWindow.SORCERY), kept.\ngranted = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(\n        parts=(\n            CostSacrifice(\n                target=Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                    filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n    effect=A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n        'amount': QConst(value=1),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n            filter=FOr(\n                children=(\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Planeswalker'),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Player'),\n                ),\n            ),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\ngrant = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n        'ability': granted,\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(\n                children=(\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                ),\n            ),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [compiled[0], grant, compiled[1], compiled[2]]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token, then attach this Equipment to it.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equipped creature has \"Sacrifice this creature: It deals 1 damage to any target.\"",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Equip {2}",
    "ir": "keywords[0], abilities[2]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Was needs-atom (the created token as 'it'); the compiler now parses sentence 1 (B15-etb-create-attach). Sentence 2 maps as a static GRANT_ABILITY of an ActivatedAbility (CostSacrifice IS_SOURCE, DEAL_DAMAGE 1 any target) to the equipped creature; the probe does not activate granted abilities, self-check packs do (bear idx -1: sacrificed, 1 damage to a creature or a player; an unequipped creature has none)."
 },
